Paper example 068: Replication reifies its count

#paper: 68
#mode: evaluation
#inlinetest:exclude Not an executable S_H/A example; see TestQuantifiedPaperIndex.
#skip
Dependent profile D (out of scope).

-- paper.cue.txt --
replicate(A, n in Nat): func(x: A, count: n) -> Vec(A, n): [
    for i in list.Range(0, count, 1) {x}
]
r: replicate("x", 3)      // ["x", "x", "x"]
